          By default, <code class="text-slate-200 font-mono">act</code> maps <code class="text-cyan-400 font-mono">ubuntu-latest</code> to a lightweight Docker image. However, official GitHub runners contain hundreds of pre-installed CLI utilities (Docker, AWS CLI, Kubectl, Python, Go, Rust). For maximum fidelity, configure <code class="text-slate-200 font-mono">catthehacker/ubuntu:act-latest</code> in a repository <code class="text-cyan-400 font-mono">.actrc</code> file:
        </p>

